WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:05.370
The 2000 Presidential Election between the
former Vice President, Al Gore, and then-governor

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:11.440
of Texas, George W. Bush, was extremely close,
with only 500 votes in the key swing state

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.160
of Florida separating the two candidates.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.470
Many people today look back on Bush's win
in 2000 with skepticism, citing the fact that

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:23.689
the vote counting in Florida, where Jeb Bush
was governor at the time, was halted before

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:28.529
all the votes could be tallied, leading the
supreme court to pre-emptively award the presidency

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:29.650
to Bush.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:35.120
In fact, the 2000 election has been called
a turning point in the decay of American democracy.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:41.440
However, in the world of the SCP foundation,
Bush's presidential win in 2000 wasn't just

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:46.730
an example of shoddy ballot counting and senate
bias, but the result of a strange case involving

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:52.110
alien parasites, body-switching, smear campaigns,
and farting cows.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.560
Yes, you heard that right.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:01.790
This is the story of SCP-4444, and the entity
simply known as “Garber Gore.”

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:08.020
SCP-4444 was first discovered in 1999 by Agents
Ringwald and Porterhouse of the FBI's Unusual

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:11.460
Incidents Unit, also known as the UIU.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.619
Ringwald and Porterhouse had been tasked with
monitoring the phone calls of then-president

00:01:15.619 --> 00:01:16.700
Bill Clinton.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.829
Clinton was having a conversation with Joe
Andrew, who was the chair of the Democratic

00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:22.109
National Committee.

00:01:22.109 --> 00:01:26.179
Joe was calling to report a couple things
about Vice President Gore - first, that he

00:01:26.179 --> 00:01:31.429
was going to announce a candidacy for the
2000 presidential bid, nothing too unexpected

00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:32.729
about that.

00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:36.350
But then he told Joe that there was an alien
in his head.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:40.429
This was followed by a white house staffer
witnessing him walk right through a solid

00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:41.429
wall.

00:01:41.429 --> 00:01:45.860
Given the strangeness of these claims, the
UIU moved in to attempt to contain the vice

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:46.860
president.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:51.770
However, this proved to be a tricky situation,
because as Joe had stated, Al Gore was able

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.659
to walk through any solid object.

00:01:54.659 --> 00:01:59.749
Unsure what to do, the UIU called in the SCP
Foundation for some much-needed backup.

00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:03.710
The nature of Mr. Gore's anomalous properties
were such that it prompted the Foundation

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:11.420
to create an entirely new containment class,
of which SCP-4444 is the only example.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:16.600
The new class, Ticonderoga, was named after
the Iroquois word for an intersection of two

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:21.439
rivers, and fittingly, the new containment
class represented an object that was in between

00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:24.480
being contained and not contained.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:30.879
SCP-4444 was to be monitored, but not apprehended,
as any attempt to do so would only aggravate

00:02:30.879 --> 00:02:32.940
his anomalous properties.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:37.470
During the initial monitoring stage, Al Gore's
home was scanned with infrared cameras in

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:42.420
an attempt to discover what might be causing
the anomalies around the vice president.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:48.770
What they found was surprising - a long hexagonal
spike engraved with alien glyphs, invisible

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:54.189
to the naked eye and apparently intangible
as well, was protruding from the back of Mr.

00:02:54.189 --> 00:02:55.849
Gore's head.

00:02:55.849 --> 00:03:00.530
Even though Al Gore could not be contained,
the SCP Foundation was still able to interview

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:05.500
him to try and ascertain the nature of the
spike and the anomalous properties it caused.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.640
Present for the interview were Gore himself,
SCP Site Director Alex Mabel, and FBI Associate

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.550
Director of Special Units, Adam Spironi.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:18.150
Initially, Spironi was uncooperative, and
Gore himself dismissed Director Mabel's claims,

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:23.469
but midway through the interview he started
to emit a strange noise, like a radio being

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.469
tuned.

00:03:24.469 --> 00:03:28.849
Wondering if this was the spike trying to
get in contact, Mabel asked “Is anyone else

00:03:28.849 --> 00:03:31.379
in there?” to which he got this response-

00:03:31.379 --> 00:03:32.620
“Wonder nuts.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.109
Name of Garber Gore.

00:03:34.109 --> 00:03:35.109
Presented?”

00:03:35.109 --> 00:03:39.219
Mabel tried to respond by introducing himself,
but Al Gore interrupted by addressing the

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:42.400
entity in the spike himself- “Well hang
on now, Garber.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.430
I haven't done proper introductions yet.”

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:48.000
Through the rest of the interview, Gore explained
his situation.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.400
The entity in his head called itself Garber
Gore, and while it could communicate verbally

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:57.940
using his voice, there was a translation barrier
that meant that its speech patterns and syntax

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.180
were often unintelligible.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.249
Gore had been aware of his situation with
Garber for just a few days, but in that time

00:04:04.249 --> 00:04:06.910
the two of them had formed something of a
bond.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:12.150
In fact, Garber was the one who convinced
Gore to run for president in the 2000 elections.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:16.639
Mabel asked Garber what it wanted on Earth,
to which it responded- “Mindthink the sustenance

00:04:16.639 --> 00:04:17.930
of Garber!

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.470
Salacious desire undertaking encouragement.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:22.169
Downsize the conquest.

00:04:22.169 --> 00:04:23.479
Strongest most strong.

00:04:23.479 --> 00:04:26.410
Garber Gore presented misunderstanding.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.970
Strongest misunderstanding "Vice" unequated.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:33.169
Goofy unnecessarity for implementation Garber
Gore on the think-stem.

00:04:33.169 --> 00:04:36.850
Improvement situational by majority gathering
selectors the vote.

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:41.580
Garber Gore succeed presidential, encouragement
arrival the greater Garber.”

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.780
Al Gore was quick to translate Garber's mangled
speech.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:49.720
As far as he understood it, Garber had been
sent out as an emissary for his species of

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:54.130
inter-dimensional, planet-hopping, parasites
that feed on thought.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.940
Garber's intention was to implant himself
in the head of the most powerful person on

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:02.169
earth in order to facilitate an easy colonization.

00:05:02.169 --> 00:05:07.010
Garber's species were non-violent and unable
to stand up to any kind of resistance, but

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:11.610
if the leader of the free world was already
merged with one of them, it would make taking

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.620
over the planet that much easier.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:19.389
However, in a misunderstanding of Earth culture,
Garber had gone for the Vice President instead

00:05:19.389 --> 00:05:21.800
of the actual commander in chief, Bill Clinton.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:27.030
Now, Garber's plan was to fix that mistake
by having Al Gore win the presidency.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.550
The SCP Foundation obviously couldn't let
this takeover go unchallenged.

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:35.890
Even though Garber's race were peaceful, seeking
only to use the thoughts of the human race

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:41.440
as a food source, further interviews and studies
revealed that they emitted insanely high levels

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.110
of carbon dioxide.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.370
To have a large number of them merged with
the human population would spell total climate

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:52.590
chaos, essentially hot-boxing the Earth to
the point it could no longer sustain life,

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:55.139
even faster than humans are doing it.

00:05:55.139 --> 00:05:59.120
Since there was no safe way to remove the
spike from the back of Al Gore's head, more

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.490
drastic measures had to be taken.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:07.759
In a meeting with the FBI, SCP Site Director
Crow presented a possible solution - an Incorporeal

00:06:07.759 --> 00:06:11.770
Entity Vacuum Chamber,
which the Foundation had seen some success

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.980
with in detaining ghosts and other apparitions.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:18.919
The only problem was, anything placed in the
chamber would explode.

00:06:18.919 --> 00:06:24.570
And, since Garber couldn't be separated from
Al Gore's head, the results would be messy.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:29.819
Since the FBI was unwilling to blow up the
vice president, that left only one choice:

00:06:29.819 --> 00:06:35.069
the SCP Foundation had to find a way to turn
American voters against Al Gore.

00:06:35.069 --> 00:06:40.110
It wouldn't be easy to do so without attracting
suspicion - in fact, it would be almost impossible

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:43.220
unless they were able to put a man on the
inside.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:47.020
Thankfully, just such a person presented themself.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:51.231
During the meeting, the FBI delegates let
the SCP Foundation members know that, while

00:06:51.231 --> 00:06:55.849
it hadn't been leaked to the press yet, George
W Bush was in a coma in the hospital after

00:06:55.849 --> 00:06:58.800
being hit by a stray bullet during a hunting
trip.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:04.039
His body was relatively undamaged, but doctors
had little hope of recovering his mind.

00:07:04.039 --> 00:07:09.350
At this point in the meeting, all the SCP
personnel present turned to look at Dr. Bright.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:14.550
He was going to be their inside man, whether
he liked it or not.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.509
The Foundation visited the hospital where
Governor Bush was being cared for, and moved

00:07:18.509 --> 00:07:21.789
him into foundation care before he could be
pronounced dead.

00:07:21.789 --> 00:07:27.569
There, doctors finished patching up his body
and SCP-963 was applied, allowing the spirit

00:07:27.569 --> 00:07:30.289
of Dr. Jack Bright to take over his mind.

00:07:30.289 --> 00:07:35.409
Jack Bright, masquerading as George Bush,
was now ready to run for office.

00:07:35.409 --> 00:07:40.129
The next step in the process was to start
a disinformation campaign against Al Gore.

00:07:40.129 --> 00:07:43.629
There were a few proposed smear campaigns
to be used against Gore.

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:47.960
The first proposal was codenamed Tarbelly
- a campaign that would have the Foundation

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.800
blame Gore for the pollution of the water
supply in a rural part of the developing world.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.530
This one was dismissed for being too outlandish.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:08:00.330
The next was Porky, which involved a rumor
that Al Gore had once been caught in a compromising

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.320
position with a pig.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:06.759
This one was dismissed due to not having access
to convincing photo editing software.

00:08:06.759 --> 00:08:11.750
The third one was codenamed Star Wars and
it involved discrediting Al Gore by saying

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.830
he believed he was in contact with aliens.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:19.460
This was obviously shot down very quickly
due to being a little too close to the truth

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.460
for comfort.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:24.640
The proposal that was eventually settled on
was codenamed The Other Monica, and the story

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:29.389
centred around the idea that Monica Lewinski
was just an innocent patsy taking the fall

00:08:29.389 --> 00:08:33.570
for the person who Bill Clinton had really
had relations with…

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.210
Al Gore.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:39.930
This rumor was the perfect combination of
salacious and being just believable enough,

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:44.560
making it the perfect thing to use to smear
Al Gore's reputation in a country that still

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.890
hadn’t come around on gay rights.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:51.290
While Director Crow continued to refine prototypes
for technology that would allow the Foundation

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:57.160
to interact physically with SCP-4444, the
Foundation staged an early September debate

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.390
between Gore and Dr. Bright posing as George
Bush.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:05.430
The idea was to create a controlled atmosphere
and mitigate any potential security risks.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:10.630
The debate was held in a church in Plainfield,
Indiana, and moderated by Jim Lehrer.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:14.940
During the debate, Garber Gore did a lot of
the talking for his human host, resulting

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:18.010
in some utterly incoherent responses.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:22.240
When asked what makes him more qualified for
the role of president than Governor Bush,

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.610
Gore responded - “When you see someone sitting
in that chair, you want to know for sure that

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:30.680
they’re the best ambivalent vicarious corncrake
caliper available for the job.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:36.089
And you can be sure that a vote for Garber
Gore is an understandimated vote for respectability,

00:09:36.089 --> 00:09:38.220
neutrality, lamp posts.”

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:42.741
In the middle of the debate, an audience plant
brought up supposed leaked photos of Al Gore

00:09:42.741 --> 00:09:45.810
and Bill Clinton engaging in their illicit
affair.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:50.500
The crowd was understandably shocked, yelling
and screaming in response.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:54.610
Now that the crowd was against Al Gore, Dr.
Bright went in for the kill.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:58.370
He asked the people in attendance - “Do
you want to see a strong man in the chair,

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.270
or a weak man under it?”

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:04.210
At this point, something weird started to
happen to the people in the crowd.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:09.250
They started full-on rioting, but then, they
started to change shape.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.850
In fact, the whole space started to shift.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:16.610
Al Gore stood up and started waving his arms,
shouting - “Garber unacceptable addition

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.560
convention terraform unto dark magicianship!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.610
Spell!

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.649
Spell!”

00:10:21.649 --> 00:10:25.560
People rushed towards the exits, but found
them blocked by the elongated forms of other

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.320
members of the audience.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:31.800
At this point the church was raided by both
Foundation personnel and the FBI.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:35.920
Garber Gore fled from the scene, returning
every attendee to normal as soon as they were

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:37.960
out of Garber's line of sight.

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:42.089
The debate was pulled from television, and
anyone who had watched it live was administered

00:10:42.089 --> 00:10:43.470
amnestics.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.730
Additional amnestics were administered to
anyone who saw Garber Gore running through

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:52.269
solid objects as he fled from Indiana to western
Ohio, where he was found hiding in the loft

00:10:52.269 --> 00:10:53.300
of a barn.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:57.111
Meanwhile, Dr. Bright was punished by the
ethics committee for his behavior during the

00:10:57.111 --> 00:11:02.180
debate, and agreed to act more in a professional
manner for the October debates.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:07.190
Most of Al Gore's campaign team were undercover
UIU agents who used audio editing to iron

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:11.770
out some of the eccentricities of Garber's
way of speaking before putting ads out.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:15.552
Most of them were able to be saved in the
edit, but some were so off-the-wall that they

00:11:15.552 --> 00:11:17.800
could never be shown to the public.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:21.690
In one of them, Al Gore stands in a field
of cows and talks about how much greenhouse

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:24.000
emissions are produced by farting cows.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:28.730
He then gives his solution to this problem
- taping plastic bags over the backsides of

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.520
every cow in America.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:35.040
Another rejected Garber Gore campaign ad that's
much shorter but just as crazy features a

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:40.190
video of a sleeping cat, with Al Gore narrating
about how everyone should shave the backs

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.660
of their heads.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:47.660
On November 7th, 2000, election night, the
SCP Foundation and the UIU watched the results

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.010
with bated breath.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:53.839
If Gore won, they'd have to be prepared to
use Director Crow's new vacuum nulifier device

00:11:53.839 --> 00:11:59.570
to simultaneously contain SCP-4444 and kill
Al Gore.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:04.089
The SCP Foundation had killed public figures
before, but never a president on the eve of

00:12:04.089 --> 00:12:05.100
his election.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:09.320
But then, Florida started to tip in favor
of Bush.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:13.920
After two days of recounting, despite losing
the popular vote, Doctor Jack Bright in the

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:18.550
body of George W. Bush was named President
of the United States.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:23.160
The Foundation expected an outburst from Garber,
but the entity remained silent.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:27.519
In fact, Al Gore has never displayed anomalous
properties again.

00:12:27.519 --> 00:12:32.070
He conceded defeat graciously and more or
less retreated from the public eye until the

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:35.389
release of his film, An Inconvenient Truth.

00:12:35.389 --> 00:12:40.540
That wasn't the last the SCP Foundation ever
heard of SCP-4444, though.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:46.600
On November 11th, 2007, a mysterious broadcast
aired on TVs across Gainesville, Florida that

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:49.490
appeared to be a lost Al Gore campaign ad.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:52.290
It shows Gore sitting on a hill by the sea.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.470
In the distance, something large drops from
the sky.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:13:02.470
Al Gore smiles and says, “I’m Al Gore,
and I want to be your last American President.”

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:11.199
Now go check out “SCP-1981 - Ronald Reagan
Cut Up While Talking &amp; SCP-095” and “SCP-3166

00:13:11.199 --> 00:13:16.260
- Monster Garfield Attack” for more SCPs
behind the scenes of real life events!

